      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and helpful store owners"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers consistently praise the family-owned team for patient customer guidance and friendly support across all pet departments. Staff members frequently help customers select puppies and supplies, though one reviewer noted inconsistency in transaction handling."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Wide selection of healthy pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers frequently highlight the broad variety of available animals, including energetic koi fish, reptiles, bunnies, birds, and puppies. While most pet parents describe lively and well-kept animals, a critical reviewer reported a bunny becoming ill shortly after purchase."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable pet food and supplies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the store's accessible pricing on pet food, feeder rodents, and general accessories, with several clients traveling across the Houston area for fair rates. A solitary complaint expressed frustration with inconsistent shelf pricing on selected items."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What types of live pets are available at the store?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The shop carries a diverse selection of live pets, including puppies, freshwater koi fish, reptiles, birds, bunnies, and small feeder animals."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Pet Place Co. carry live feeder insects and rodents?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners report regular availability of feeder rats in various sizes and healthy feeder worms for reptiles."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are puppies vaccinated before being sold?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers mention that puppies are vaccinated and well cared for, with staff providing full health paperwork during adoption."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the store offer aquarium supplies and setup materials?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The store stocks freshwater fish tank supplies, filters, gravel, and decorative accessories for home and school aquarium projects."
      },
      "basis": "both"
